{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"前一段还能够安静地待在满足里，这里却开始真正承受它不能被留住的后果：不舍变得更具体，也多了一种失去着力点后的悬着和隐隐的紧张。可这种难受并不是失望——人仍然知道此前得到的东西是真的，只是已经不能继续靠身在其中来安顿自己。\",\"thread\":\"前一段已经知道，真正的满足并不因此成为可以永久握住的东西；这里这件事不再只是一个被理解的限度，而开始成为必须实际承受的代价。因为这份回应已经被充分确认，人无法靠贬低它来让离开变得容易；也正因为它确实给过自己真正需要的东西，当它不再能够继续承载自己时，留下的就不是最初那种不知道该相信什么的空悬，而是知道自己失去了什么、却又没有理由否认它曾经真实存在的悬着。因此这里既有更深的不舍和不安，也保留着对那份满足的信任。\",\"used\":\"第6至第8段：人已经确认这种回应确实触到自己真正未被安顿的需要，并逐渐能够完整接受它；尤其第8段已经建立，真正的满足可以充分成立，却不能因此被永久握住。\",\"new\":[\"人不仅开始明白满足不能被永久占有，也开始实际承受不再拥有它时的代价。\",\"一份真实的满足退开以后，人可以仍然承认它的价值；因此随之而来的空悬不必重新变成对过去的怀疑。\",\"越清楚什么曾经真正满足过自己，它不再在场时的缺失也会越具体，而不再只是模糊的未满足。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "926885d6-11cb-40c9-b0d2-88f8d41d3f4b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T220710231717Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.359, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:09:01.595512+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4d88a3d2f44c57b182c54e5548849cad5ec16854ad63e507c741389b2f410447", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T220710231717Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9c0dc14f71161538c05ff5c752c80016c35e8c4202adbe31fde28fbb624d5678"}}}
